            "review_title": "Review at Quán Bụi Express",
            "review_text": "Hải L\n2 contributions\n0\nJul 2025\nQuán Bụi Express is a great spot for lovers of Vietnamese cuisine. The dishes are full of authentic flavor and beautifully presented – especially the broken rice, sour soup, and fresh spring rolls. The space is clean, cozy, and tastefully decorated with a rustic charm. Staff are friendly, attentive, and efficient. A high-quality dining experience in the heart of the city!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 25, 2025\nDanh Tran\nDear,\n\nQuán Bụi sincerely thanks you for taking the time to share your experience at our restaurant. We are very happy to know that you had a wonderful experience.\n\nYour satisfaction is Quán Bụi's greatest pride and motivation. The restaurant constantly strives to bring delicious and complete meals to all diners.\n\nQuán Bụi understands that during the peak tourist season, the increased number of customers can lead to some minor inconveniences in the service process. Although our staff has tried their best, unexpected errors can still occur. Quán Bụi hopes to receive your understanding regarding the pressures during this period.\n\nReserving a table in advance will help you proactively secure a seat upon arrival and choose your favorite dishes, saving you waiting time.\n\nQuán Bụi hopes to continue to be your favorite culinary destination for your next meals. We always look forward to serving you the most delicious dishes and the most attentive service.\n\nSincerely,\nThe Quán Bụi Team\nRead more\nWritten July 30, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
